# YouTube ingestion pipeline (scripts/youtube-ingest/) -- only the pipeline
# SOURCE is versioned. Runtime binaries, the embedded Python distribution,
# ASR models, and any downloaded audio/video/caption files are per-machine
# tooling, never committed. Real transcript output lives outside this repo
# entirely (see YOUTUBE_INGEST_RESEARCH_ROOT in the tool's README), so this
# is a defensive backstop, not the primary boundary.
# (scoped to this directory only, not **/*.vtt -- test/fixtures/*.vtt below stays tracked)
scripts/youtube-ingest/bin/
scripts/youtube-ingest/python/
scripts/youtube-ingest/python-installer/
scripts/youtube-ingest/temp-audio/
scripts/youtube-ingest/*.mp3
scripts/youtube-ingest/*.wav
scripts/youtube-ingest/*.vtt
scripts/youtube-ingest/*.asr.json
